   $q$Paragraph 4 begins with the sentence "Red is different." What role does this sentence play?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It briefly restates the main point that paragraph 3 explained.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-role"},{"text":"It states the central claim that the entire passage sets out to prove.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-broad"},{"text":"It introduces the cause that makes chlorophyll break down in autumn.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"It signals a contrast between how red appears and how yellow and orange do.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It signals a contrast between how red appears and how yellow and orange do.$q$, $q$The paragraph goes on to explain that red pigments, unlike yellow and orange, are made new in autumn. The sentence sets up that difference rather than repeating paragraph 3.$q$, 'draft', '9d669a71-47e6-5bb8-981f-6a86d8c0dad4')
