   $q$What is the purpose of the last sentence of paragraph 1, "Surprisingly, they fight sound by making more sound"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It presents a puzzling idea that makes readers curious about the explanation.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It explains exactly how the tiny microphone in each earcup works.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"It describes a limit on which kinds of sounds the headphones can block.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-paragraphs"},{"text":"It concludes that the headphones actually make the noise much worse.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It presents a puzzling idea that makes readers curious about the explanation.$q$, $q$The idea of fighting sound with sound seems backward, so it hooks readers, and the passage then explains it. The limits on which sounds can be canceled appear in paragraph 5.$q$, 'draft', '044b491b-0681-5dc8-9385-98b6837d00fe')
